# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Samsung Odyssey 3D (G90XF): the scaler's vendor device (SCSI vendor "GCREADER", a /dev/sgN). Only for
# any2odyssey-scaler, which is experimental and off unless asked for (docs/LENS-SWITCH.md, "The scaler's 3D
# mode"): it lets the person at the seat send that device its 3D-mode command. Installed only by the
# installer's step 6 (install.sh --scaler), or by hand.
#
# After copying this file: "sudo udevadm control --reload", then unplug and replug the monitor's USB cable
# (or switch the monitor off and on). odysseyvk-linux reports that "udevadm trigger" on this device
# re-initialises the monitor's hub and takes the lens board and the webcam off the bus until then.
SUBSYSTEM=="scsi_generic", SUBSYSTEMS=="scsi", ATTRS{vendor}=="GCREADER*", TAG+="uaccess"
